    "body": "An assigned ASHA can open a minimal mobile household/proxy evidence screen from Today and inspect only permitted current relationships, recorded proxy evidence and purpose-limited name previews. The server retains authoritative identity, assignment, purpose and existing sharing predicates; it does not create households, grants, encounters, send records or run providers.\n\nReads use current bounded state and consistent final patient/assignment/operations proofs. Unknown accounts do not bootstrap data; due/held transfers refuse409 and corrupt transfer data refuses503 without applying the scheduler. A future assignment deadline clears protected content. Missing undefined household references remain known absence; unresolved or present malformed references refuse instead of becoming false known-none. Separate original Today remains responsible for scheduled transfer processing. Prior unwanted read mutations and malformed-reference failures are retained.\n\nValidation at source5dfab134 and final metadata3a776759:\n-60 pure checks independently repeated,60 actual backend/mobile checks,94 original guarded checks; all original60-table read phases unchanged except audit/metrics, no external provider.\n- Root current authorization64, route smoke32 plus1 inherited media skip, UAT tooling63, types, build and inherited lint1392 error ceiling pass (627 warnings; not clean lint).\n- Original389 guard objects/minima, whole7-job workflow, criteria/364 formal cases and goldens unchanged; only measured60unit/60native guarded suites and one additiveCIstep.\n-12 exact historical source-only bindings preserve immutable original manifests and preimages. Current1903 source pins are independently checked;291 archived compiled files are the measured author build, not a future commit build identity.\n- Root20 full-checker/5inlineCI refusal controls; different-agent source and final metadata reviews pass. Final metadata reviewer independently executes4checker refusals/5inline controls and verifies the corrected /today UAT start path. Prior wrong-path/stale-pack/hash failures retained.\n\nDevelopment subset of APL-39/SAHA016, taskAPL-199. Exact-head CI begins after publication. Full household/proxy creation, sharing, combined care, clinical/domain/human/physical/formal acceptance and hosting remain open. No whole-story completion, merge or deployed SHA is claimed.",
    "title": "Assigned ASHA household and proxy evidence with nonmutating scope checks",
